<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n56010" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατοικο-δομέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>build upon</i> or <i>in</i> a place, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι δημόσιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Ath.</u>
					3.4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς ὁδούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Ath.</u>
					50.2
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, of the place, <i>to be built on</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ge.</u>
				36.43
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				5.4.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>squander in building</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Publ.</u>
				15
			</span></i> (but simply, <i>use in building</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλίνθου τῆς -δομηθείσης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PPetr.</u>
					3p.141
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>shut up in a house</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Is.
				8.41
			</span></i> (s.v.l.), cf. Harp.
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατῳκοδόμησε</span>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>to be built up. blocked up</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σανίσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					66.25
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
